      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ae3d1bed05fc9c53029702dad93a68c0c121d5bda01add864839dbf1cbbe6cf",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa20fd840108a702d7f338388e296fe761278e68e73b88fe4592dd357756d520",
      "text": "Source Code",
      "hash": "bc47da663d101bfc1d4edcb3762f37fbe8fab3e931cfd460c69cb432b806d419"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e928c05e25af0c25cfeab904b8339201277845e42dc43c38db26bb911c8d0f1",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "06c356b656fcf4b6a424cc80a3148f2cbee57c239c684187007f75565cac0435",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "240b7d4bc04e81b7bf7ce1e82542a5fb26848117ae62e546e69472189433cc18",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "85b56e2b556f60b12513afc2f12f8e0da46d25922d92d24a0a1cb2ebaf6660ea",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "7326ea488c1d043e7eb8cd0308b926ec7e3cf477eae29e84a391405b6eb2af3d",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab2802e56b52ea6b90d1fc9144515353a3bb9246de169abd4ce80f02a2971653",
      "text": "Often the thing that you want to get back from your LLM is not text but some kind of object.",
      "hash": "66125d2f8a040040c6eacf265aed850d383dfbafe7b01d7961e36e7004943128"
    },
    {
      "id": "635547f7a98bd0ce32a271ee288fb21152300e9b21f36dd6a74780b6887f83c4",
      "text": "You might want to scan a bank statement for multiple properties, like the account number and the balance.",
      "hash": "3afe021b28f40a5b53e576c3072e416dd3e05296ae7d14f183ab24d2c7a80432"
    },
    {
      "id": "86e34c38e4396643a629cf0bfe3cea0a90056fd8e7a94262ac9b78dc74097fe2",
      "text": "The most efficient way to do this is with structured outputs.",
      "hash": "d976080d30a5064351b914dd60c158487b9727275bc73626b4116dd9d03eab08"
    },
    {
      "id": "f55bd29b38e39f1bb55e9c516ba6bed9af50ca8a9becda597a2c3a8a76c44132",
      "text": "This lets you ask the LLM a question, tell it what format you want the answer in, and then it will send you that information in that format.",
      "hash": "fc05b698d51dbc887372035b6e908040c5e5d10efc7485aaeee559fc3d12ad6c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c717db843b237d90b4be48129529acca0c68ff590081ebb691ef0c07dafbc5e2",
      "text": "In this example, we're going to ask the LLM for a recipe. We want the recipe name, an array of ingredients, and an array of steps that the chef needs to take to make the recipe.",
      "hash": "1c46fe5be3dc6e582c308765470b1a9ceff32bb9474eba801cfe1c898af8e09f"
    },
    {
      "id": "43929f610cafd4ca7aa4eb294a99a1382cb493f4e38fd8ab473e7fd9a4739b24",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "b330e272c64086cc84c272e9c412de227a495259408faa996bfe60e021877302",
      "text": "The first step is to create a",
      "hash": "544617556124e67a36be5589d0bbb18c97cf7098909eef6ecdc9408caa7071aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c4173a9a7518a6f1665d618bccf402637a1fe326e573ef1e001a0f048b3b79c",
      "text": "schema that describes the data type that we want to get back from the LLM.",
      "hash": "71b739a7cc417971ff55e8cb59865190dd4d3f044d2bda5ecc17754aa33cf8ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "2d737825b4bd9c494fcda86996d03091620488f6efe13a823a5305651bd97125",
      "text": "If you've never seen",
      "hash": "89b92d1b9fda33a1060fb37552cde30331aefe8acd1ec069a429752bfb86337e"
    },
    {
      "id": "84261d6362215dc0c8612caead0b86fe2d031a169ccdb3e01f8c1290d3a4812c",
      "text": "before, I have a",
      "hash": "4f0af26ad1c53e261117e0d99da60405cc4bbf51fb43450b7fd18995b4eaa3dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "774055c2a76024c1d622e96503f6af5b12e2137261aa0b4833f5f9804e0af6a4",
      "text": "free tutorial",
      "hash": "fb3fd9c4d1f06a1e3748e7e95deb6a53753555b8780d55079fba288740a29fec"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2d13119a456e1e2a569b73b749407f2c7405923777f1f0d43be1e55d865cace",
      "text": "on my sister site, Total TypeScript.",
      "hash": "c0bc3fdaedf4a808d8415bc0366a16c9ba140d65acc444bfeeb8fc39d69e193a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a519a127be02c9aecd62990611312d1111103c9593ac48f5f43e7f561ef344f3",
      "text": "To describe the recipe shape that we have here the",
      "hash": "2ae654bb8938663fdc3247f57d63dbbb7cdddcef024b2b670f0ced2cfdb4e7c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "1fb8c23e1ece95b889f889cfaae2edf5d6c19f4302ba759f71315bcb613f036e",
      "text": "schema would look like this:",
      "hash": "05dc426d1869e684c4952f3f59d4874a6bc1227159fbc8c633aeb303b1a9c787"
    },
    {
      "id": "b36d1b7ed776f849ef7606e98047baa546f3c99abea7da9a6a81b4a726368d56",
      "text": "We can pass this schema directly to the",
      "hash": "33e914839f184808008bcbf75ac65a7ca804500776d7529f2d3cc605939d7ed3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9f716db7922544636c13bd8be6274383e568b237b9e585da13df8edee10c7d2",
      "text": "function from the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "bec4439bbcf0fd20fc462814595529fd6dd33662ca1b90eb317ac8895e8e35d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "4238d5db1da90db28ddfee70f2aee088efe3885dc0b00566913b95db829a1a41",
      "text": "I've also added a simple system prompt here to give the AI some context as to what we're doing.",
      "hash": "a6892a4552a08267198a5e8417d53c996990a822473520feb0ee244968df4971"
    },
    {
      "id": "605f0dc36d0b9f898ee05ea198bab901a4b6ec75ef2fa963787a6b9f8071c325",
      "text": "The result that comes back contains a property called",
      "hash": "85644d6ea626a6cfff2a94bfad3550b12bd580543f95eba3595396d9c96a6fb5"
    },
    {
      "id": "82c0a6c6d887ca5b1449e2a808b518455cc90bc28bcda3ca5a873223f6434909",
      "text": "which contains our recipe.",
      "hash": "aca60d8ea2b001882024e235dc9bb651f0acda12b8d5eb9339c3a970ae94f37e"
    },
    {
      "id": "fba0f64e48febeb2a9e6c6b5a4ebb05db3b2ca8dfe5496150e700cd766586d12",
      "text": "Thanks to TypeScript being clever, we also get type-safe access to the",
      "hash": "b75c982c2d352679df6b3627295bbadc736602736b742d11b3594bf83f01c874"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b45fe5c7e60e8485945e9c148c7f842a10948d786370d53d084424d2ed32475",
      "text": ", and",
      "hash": "4aa9bfd2f175a94ad5a7cb321e1aea9790c73eb366a3415b47a00aeaa9fbf24a"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c299f5bd5bac4058a6ed52464b10188877f69b8e7390f094535dfa076d68385",
      "text": "Describing Properties",
      "hash": "50eba13c58ecedc37b7e92bf0ddb7433a52674e8180f73337af3d7854df7f785"
    },
    {
      "id": "910e48818a0a034510da3daa5f5ec3cb02ef235093b8c85a2f4c9940a3d40589",
      "text": "But we're not quite done here. We should provide the AI with more information about what each individual property means.",
      "hash": "175304306125912f7157a021e11bce327c2e4abd2d836cd3eaf5bc55952e19c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a0ee1c760d436b98c55b496fed59e78f3e4be35f0a5fd8f8061f3f8ef92b8a2",
      "text": "Currently, all it's got to go on are",
      "hash": "0ac2cbead0b80be12474c1edc62f14d40710a210909976c989e97531c7d83ed4"
    },
    {
      "id": "d783437362b25b129906004a1638ab73cb7045ff55a0bc1fa93594c31234d1d7",
      "text": "We can do this by adding",
      "hash": "706ff6b50e8871abaea3696420e04ec40c523636926a4ec13431273984199fc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b92e493b5bcd1c179b99d7b24b47b181748c92475b779b6e9fd0b2a94e2c4625",
      "text": "'s",
      "hash": "edc00d4db80ddc3e91783b63ae5fbcdfd204de983c650e9587785a40271c8f3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "f24a5d7392071787f2ae0158eaa532d9673ce7ea319e147e0b4494acd438a7b8",
      "text": "function on each property.",
      "hash": "f6176855c44aea10fab52a60258db37bd7856de575147bc1b7f9a208468d4462"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4de4d18110d61e189d1d42d17a97ff683459f016129fda1652ed7c6695c96f5",
      "text": "Now it's clear to the AI what we're asking for from each property. This is especially useful when the property names are not that descriptive.",
      "hash": "9c76f155cab2bddc16fd3be745d3b11524de02f5ca11a7646b2d38c95b823be5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2286643c52e2f4fcd2ca0be111c5cfe1fb197f031bec71c524bff6b5d89bedc4",
      "text": "And finally, we can pass a",
      "hash": "36bb385d7cabc477dbf26580b11b449e6a4b7cb9531102f7e882bd04a7784fc5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec0f249cc0cb48f6ed3b7dcc49914b7aa6bb8874ff4dcc53faef830d634e37fb",
      "text": "property to the",
      "hash": "1b438a6d3e6ce20d3f96a39d45e529c1771585134c87e17d48299cf61ba06b00"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e015c68d7a191e6c042704f160d422fca046654807faf6b613abc91e007db58",
      "text": "function:",
      "hash": "671d7c1c412c57f3454b1f26c745f6f4d01fbe7cb5f68b76cc8b93c58a8f6aec"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad06b34ce0df39d7702b0a7798630362dafd4c458a40ed05c9de504dc4663216",
      "text": "Let's give this a go and see what outputs we get. Let's ask how to make Baba Ganoush.",
      "hash": "19858e223b9454142fbb191a3681c77d727652d456e6f9178979a9e5fe100211"
    },
    {
      "id": "370af654138a8e1ea130adc6604e6cc3171ec7a5b3363725215b9954c010154f",
      "text": "When we run this, we're going to get back a recipe for Baba Ganoush.",
      "hash": "cf639728bfdbea3755c3f552c53d1f12269dd6cc6178e6c835c368d1be0ab9e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "f95f479feebc3222c8a11dcffdcaa4884325014028c9eaa84030a10be59b25e7",
      "text": "And there we go, that's how you get structured outputs from the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "17b91a7e7cfc3847f34def1df853ed8dfe3c55eefac06e33b64942dca1c4827b"
    },
